  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "真正的顶级家风，从不是富贵传承，谢长达的育人智慧，值得所有父母借鉴。他一手缔造了中国顶级豪门，他的八个子女皆是社会名人，五个孙辈，其中四个为院士，一个重孙名扬国内外，他的名字叫谢长达。他以坚韧不拔的意志和非凡的智慧，一手缔造了中国顶级豪门，培养出的八个子女结成为社会名人，孙辈中更是人才辈出。其中五个为院士，一个重孙名扬国内外。他的名字注定铭刻在中国近代史上，成为女性力量与智慧的象征。身为晚清寡母谢，长达的人生开局，堪称绝境，中年丧夫，独自养家。九孩待养家，净清贫，乱世求生。没有优越的物质条件，没有优质的教育资源，没有亲友扶持助力，甚至身处女性，地位极低、教育资源匮乏的时代。可他硬生生将一手烂牌打成王炸，让所有子女突破时代局限，逆袭成才。孙辈更是登顶行业巅峰，为国争光。很多人误以为世家成才靠的是天赋、运气、资源，实则不然。王氏家族的传奇核心源于谢长达坚守的四大育人准则，简单通透，却极具力量，值得每一位家长学习借鉴。第一，以身作则，自立自强，给孩子最正的精神底色。谢长达医生育人最核心的四个字就是以身作则。她从不空谈道理，不苛求孩子，所有要求孩子做到的自己首先做到。丈夫离世后，她从未自怨自艾，消极沉沦，也从未向孩子灌输苦难，抱怨命运，反而直面困境，咬牙支撑他用一张自我跪拜的照片，教会孩子万事靠自己，求人不如求己。生活结局，他不投不强，不卑不亢，凭自己的能力撑起全家。时代落后。他终身学习与时俱进，主动接纳新思想，拥抱新变革、地位受限。他不甘平庸，主动破局，办学兴教，推动女权公益助人。在他的言传身教下，所有子女都养成了坚韧、自强、独立、自律、永不言弃的性格，不依附他人，不畏惧困境，遇事迎难而上，主动破局，这是孩子一生最珍贵的财富。第二，重视教育，终身读书，守住家庭最好的家风。谢长达一生。最坚定的信仰就是读书育人，哪怕家徒四壁、度日施难，他也绝不牺牲孩子的学业，始终坚持全员读书，因材施教。他打破生时代偏见，不重男女，不分长幼。所有孩子一律平等接受教育，打破应试局限，不为分数，不为功名，鼓励孩子深耕，热爱发挥特长。他深知读书，不是为了追名逐利，而是为了修身，立命，发宽学局。因此，他鼓励子女兼修中西学识，既要懂传统、明德行，也要懂科学拓视野，不强迫孩子走统一的人生道路，尊重每个孩子的天赋与热爱，擅长理科的深耕科研，热爱教育的教书育人，有志实业的实干兴邦。这种因材施教、尊重天性的教育方式，让每个孩子都能最大化发挥自身优势，成就独一无二的人生。第三，格局开阔，心怀家国，拔高孩子的人生高度。普通家长育人，只求孩子安稳度日，衣食无忧，平淡一生。但谢长达的育人格局，从来不止于小家安稳，更在于大国担当。她一生推动放逐运动，创办女子学校，成立公益团体。不求名利，不计得失成为唤益女性振兴教育。助力家国母亲的家国情怀、大爱格局深深浸润着每一位子女。因此，王室后人成才后无一追逐，富贵享乐，全部扎根。科研哪育实业一线默默深耕，为国奉献子女奠基。近代学科发展孙辈，攻克核心技术，助力国家崛起，哪怕放弃海外，高薪优渥条件也要归国，建设祖国格局决定结局。正是这份心怀家国的家风，让家族后辈跳出个人得失，拥有了更高的人生追求与精神境界。第四，无私奉献，疏财助学，传承利他向善的家风。谢长达一生清贫、乐善好施，始终坚守利他初心，深耕工工艺，帮扶弱者。一九一五年，他牵头成立苏州女子工艺团，专门帮扶底层弱势女性，开设就业培训，提供法律援助，开展公益义诊庇护。受欺凌受压迫的女性，被苏州百姓亲切称作王老虎，专替弱者撑腰，为女性发声。他一生积蓄大多用于办学助学、公益帮扶，七十岁受遗悉数捐校，临终遗嘱捐赠全部奠移设立奖学金，一生与人终身奉献。这份无私向善、利他担当的品格，代代传承让，家族后辈始终心怀善意，懂得感恩、勇于奉献。成才之后，不忘反哺社会、报效国家，成就了家族百年不衰的口碑与底蕴。回看谢长达的一生，他不是高官权贵，不是富商巨骨，只是一位裹着小脚，历经风雨的普通母亲。但他用一生证明，真正的豪门从不是财富的堆积，而是家风的堆承。真正的育儿，从不是物质的堆积，而是精神的滋养。世间所有的岁月静好，家族荣光，结缘于前辈的负重前行，深耕坚守谢，长达以一介女子之躯，活成了时代标杆。母亲典范。她的坚韧通透，善良，担当，跨越百年，依旧治愈世人启迪后人。最好的家庭教育，从来不是给孩子最好的一切，而是自己活成最好的榜样。传承一身风骨，一世善良，一生自强。这便是谢长达留给后世最珍贵最值得传承的人生智慧。乱世无人撑腰，他自己做官，一生无依无靠，他活成整座家族的靠山，这样的中国女性值得被更多人看见。点赞，致敬先辈，转发，传递力量。喜欢这种温柔又有力量的故事，记得关注我。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1410,
      "text": "真正的顶级家风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1690,
      "end_ms": 3270,
      "text": "从不是富贵传承，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4130,
      "end_ms": 5850,
      "text": "谢长达的育人智慧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6150,
      "end_ms": 8230,
      "text": "值得所有父母借鉴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8630,
      "end_ms": 11590,
      "text": "他一手缔造了中国顶级豪门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12270,
      "end_ms": 14830,
      "text": "他的八个子女皆是社会名人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15250,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "五个孙辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16610,
      "end_ms": 18170,
      "text": "其中四个为院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18470,
      "end_ms": 20630,
      "text": "一个重孙名扬国内外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21170,
      "end_ms": 22730,
      "text": "他的名字叫谢长达。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23490,
      "end_ms": 26430,
      "text": "他以坚韧不拔的意志和非凡的智慧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26770,
      "end_ms": 29755,
      "text": "一手缔造了中国顶级豪门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30280,
      "end_ms": 33700,
      "text": "培养出的八个子女结成为社会名人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34100,
      "end_ms": 36820,
      "text": "孙辈中更是人才辈出。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36940,
      "end_ms": 38600,
      "text": "其中五个为院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38800,
      "end_ms": 40700,
      "text": "一个重孙名扬国内外。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 41420,
      "end_ms": 45180,
      "text": "他的名字注定铭刻在中国近代史上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45780,
      "end_ms": 48900,
      "text": "成为女性力量与智慧的象征。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49800,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "身为晚清寡母谢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51840,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "长达的人生开局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53580,
      "end_ms": 54760,
      "text": "堪称绝境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55560,
      "end_ms": 56620,
      "text": "中年丧夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56880,
      "end_ms": 57940,
      "text": "独自养家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58280,
      "end_ms": 59875,
      "text": "九孩待养家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 60110,
      "end_ms": 60915,
      "text": "净清贫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 61290,
      "end_ms": 62305,
      "text": "乱世求生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 63150,
      "end_ms": 64835,
      "text": "没有优越的物质条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 65130,
      "end_ms": 66745,
      "text": "没有优质的教育资源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67190,
      "end_ms": 69095,
      "text": "没有亲友扶持助力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 69530,
      "end_ms": 70830,
      "text": "甚至身处女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 70890,
      "end_ms": 74290,
      "text": "地位极低、教育资源匮乏的时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 74390,
      "end_ms": 78035,
      "text": "可他硬生生将一手烂牌打成王炸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 78550,
      "end_ms": 81045,
      "text": "让所有子女突破时代局限，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 81500,
      "end_ms": 82360,
      "text": "逆袭成才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 82680,
      "end_ms": 85205,
      "text": "孙辈更是登顶行业巅峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 85560,
      "end_ms": 86495,
      "text": "为国争光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 87120,
      "end_ms": 93030,
      "text": "很多人误以为世家成才靠的是天赋、运气、资源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93440,
      "end_ms": 94145,
      "text": "实则不然。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 95190,
      "end_ms": 101465,
      "text": "王氏家族的传奇核心源于谢长达坚守的四大育人准则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102150,
      "end_ms": 103245,
      "text": "简单通透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 103590,
      "end_ms": 104655,
      "text": "却极具力量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 105220,
      "end_ms": 107485,
      "text": "值得每一位家长学习借鉴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 108160,
      "end_ms": 108610,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 108910,
      "end_ms": 110005,
      "text": "以身作则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 110380,
      "end_ms": 111325,
      "text": "自立自强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 111730,
      "end_ms": 113890,
      "text": "给孩子最正的精神底色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114130,
      "end_ms": 119205,
      "text": "谢长达医生育人最核心的四个字就是以身作则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 119910,
      "end_ms": 121650,
      "text": "她从不空谈道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 121750,
      "end_ms": 122910,
      "text": "不苛求孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123250,
      "end_ms": 126810,
      "text": "所有要求孩子做到的自己首先做到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127290,
      "end_ms": 128470,
      "text": "丈夫离世后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128770,
      "end_ms": 130510,
      "text": "她从未自怨自艾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 130850,
      "end_ms": 131950,
      "text": "消极沉沦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132370,
      "end_ms": 134630,
      "text": "也从未向孩子灌输苦难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135350,
      "end_ms": 136310,
      "text": "抱怨命运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136610,
      "end_ms": 138110,
      "text": "反而直面困境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138410,
      "end_ms": 142410,
      "text": "咬牙支撑他用一张自我跪拜的照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 142990,
      "end_ms": 145170,
      "text": "教会孩子万事靠自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 145450,
      "end_ms": 147150,
      "text": "求人不如求己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147630,
      "end_ms": 148650,
      "text": "生活结局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 148890,
      "end_ms": 150020,
      "text": "他不投不强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 150160,
      "end_ms": 150940,
      "text": "不卑不亢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 151020,
      "end_ms": 153280,
      "text": "凭自己的能力撑起全家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 153820,
      "end_ms": 154720,
      "text": "时代落后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 154920,
      "end_ms": 157300,
      "text": "他终身学习与时俱进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 157740,
      "end_ms": 159500,
      "text": "主动接纳新思想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 159800,
      "end_ms": 162260,
      "text": "拥抱新变革、地位受限。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 162540,
      "end_ms": 163700,
      "text": "他不甘平庸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 163980,
      "end_ms": 164880,
      "text": "主动破局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 165380,
      "end_ms": 166440,
      "text": "办学兴教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 166780,
      "end_ms": 168960,
      "text": "推动女权公益助人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 169680,
      "end_ms": 171420,
      "text": "在他的言传身教下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 171780,
      "end_ms": 178240,
      "text": "所有子女都养成了坚韧、自强、独立、自律、永不言弃的性格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 178500,
      "end_ms": 179495,
      "text": "不依附他人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 180100,
      "end_ms": 181360,
      "text": "不畏惧困境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 181680,
      "end_ms": 183100,
      "text": "遇事迎难而上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 183360,
      "end_ms": 184240,
      "text": "主动破局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 184720,
      "end_ms": 187220,
      "text": "这是孩子一生最珍贵的财富。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 188280,
      "end_ms": 188720,
      "text": "第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 188760,
      "end_ms": 189740,
      "text": "重视教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 189920,
      "end_ms": 191000,
      "text": "终身读书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 191320,
      "end_ms": 193340,
      "text": "守住家庭最好的家风。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 194100,
      "end_ms": 195120,
      "text": "谢长达一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 195420,
      "end_ms": 198840,
      "text": "最坚定的信仰就是读书育人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 199580,
      "end_ms": 202420,
      "text": "哪怕家徒四壁、度日施难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 202760,
      "end_ms": 204940,
      "text": "他也绝不牺牲孩子的学业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 205400,
      "end_ms": 207280,
      "text": "始终坚持全员读书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 207520,
      "end_ms": 208380,
      "text": "因材施教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 208380,
      "end_ms": 210610,
      "text": "他打破生时代偏见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 210850,
      "end_ms": 211670,
      "text": "不重男女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 211850,
      "end_ms": 212690,
      "text": "不分长幼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 213370,
      "end_ms": 216110,
      "text": "所有孩子一律平等接受教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 216490,
      "end_ms": 217830,
      "text": "打破应试局限，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 218070,
      "end_ms": 218850,
      "text": "不为分数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 219430,
      "end_ms": 220530,
      "text": "不为功名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 220890,
      "end_ms": 222390,
      "text": "鼓励孩子深耕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 222510,
      "end_ms": 224010,
      "text": "热爱发挥特长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 224350,
      "end_ms": 225910,
      "text": "他深知读书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 226130,
      "end_ms": 227770,
      "text": "不是为了追名逐利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 227790,
      "end_ms": 228850,
      "text": "而是为了修身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 228890,
      "end_ms": 229330,
      "text": "立命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 229750,
      "end_ms": 230710,
      "text": "发宽学局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 231190,
      "end_ms": 231610,
      "text": "因此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 231610,
      "end_ms": 234110,
      "text": "他鼓励子女兼修中西学识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 235030,
      "end_ms": 237650,
      "text": "既要懂传统、明德行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 238070,
      "end_ms": 240380,
      "text": "也要懂科学拓视野，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 241140,
      "end_ms": 244020,
      "text": "不强迫孩子走统一的人生道路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 244440,
      "end_ms": 246840,
      "text": "尊重每个孩子的天赋与热爱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 247260,
      "end_ms": 249460,
      "text": "擅长理科的深耕科研，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 250080,
      "end_ms": 251920,
      "text": "热爱教育的教书育人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 252280,
      "end_ms": 254660,
      "text": "有志实业的实干兴邦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 255540,
      "end_ms": 259100,
      "text": "这种因材施教、尊重天性的教育方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 259540,
      "end_ms": 262920,
      "text": "让每个孩子都能最大化发挥自身优势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 263160,
      "end_ms": 264840,
      "text": "成就独一无二的人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 266540,
      "end_ms": 267000,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 267100,
      "end_ms": 268140,
      "text": "格局开阔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 268640,
      "end_ms": 269695,
      "text": "心怀家国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 270730,
      "end_ms": 272570,
      "text": "拔高孩子的人生高度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 273270,
      "end_ms": 274610,
      "text": "普通家长育人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 275030,
      "end_ms": 277370,
      "text": "只求孩子安稳度日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 277650,
      "end_ms": 278610,
      "text": "衣食无忧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 278950,
      "end_ms": 279990,
      "text": "平淡一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 281110,
      "end_ms": 283230,
      "text": "但谢长达的育人格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 283710,
      "end_ms": 285630,
      "text": "从来不止于小家安稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 285890,
      "end_ms": 287290,
      "text": "更在于大国担当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 287830,
      "end_ms": 289690,
      "text": "她一生推动放逐运动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00127",
      "start_ms": 289930,
      "end_ms": 291190,
      "text": "创办女子学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00128",
      "start_ms": 291450,
      "end_ms": 292730,
      "text": "成立公益团体。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00129",
      "start_ms": 293170,
      "end_ms": 294110,
      "text": "不求名利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00130",
      "start_ms": 294270,
      "end_ms": 298545,
      "text": "不计得失成为唤益女性振兴教育。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00131",
      "start_ms": 299000,
      "end_ms": 306100,
      "text": "助力家国母亲的家国情怀、大爱格局深深浸润着每一位子女。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00132",
      "start_ms": 306180,
      "end_ms": 306640,
      "text": "因此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00133",
      "start_ms": 307000,
      "end_ms": 310040,
      "text": "王室后人成才后无一追逐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00134",
      "start_ms": 310300,
      "end_ms": 311300,
      "text": "富贵享乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00135",
      "start_ms": 311620,
      "end_ms": 312740,
      "text": "全部扎根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00136",
      "start_ms": 312760,
      "end_ms": 317160,
      "text": "科研哪育实业一线默默深耕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00137",
      "start_ms": 317340,
      "end_ms": 320460,
      "text": "为国奉献子女奠基。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00138",
      "start_ms": 320720,
      "end_ms": 322980,
      "text": "近代学科发展孙辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00139",
      "start_ms": 323140,
      "end_ms": 324460,
      "text": "攻克核心技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00140",
      "start_ms": 324680,
      "end_ms": 325840,
      "text": "助力国家崛起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00141",
      "start_ms": 326260,
      "end_ms": 327500,
      "text": "哪怕放弃海外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00142",
      "start_ms": 327500,
      "end_ms": 329930,
      "text": "高薪优渥条件也要归国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00143",
      "start_ms": 330230,
      "end_ms": 333590,
      "text": "建设祖国格局决定结局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00144",
      "start_ms": 334070,
      "end_ms": 336470,
      "text": "正是这份心怀家国的家风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00145",
      "start_ms": 336930,
      "end_ms": 340050,
      "text": "让家族后辈跳出个人得失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00146",
      "start_ms": 340430,
      "end_ms": 344830,
      "text": "拥有了更高的人生追求与精神境界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00147",
      "start_ms": 345910,
      "end_ms": 346390,
      "text": "第四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00148",
      "start_ms": 346650,
      "end_ms": 347650,
      "text": "无私奉献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00149",
      "start_ms": 347830,
      "end_ms": 348730,
      "text": "疏财助学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00150",
      "start_ms": 349230,
      "end_ms": 351490,
      "text": "传承利他向善的家风。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00151",
      "start_ms": 352250,
      "end_ms": 355010,
      "text": "谢长达一生清贫、乐善好施，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00152",
      "start_ms": 355570,
      "end_ms": 357410,
      "text": "始终坚守利他初心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00153",
      "start_ms": 357950,
      "end_ms": 359310,
      "text": "深耕工工艺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00154",
      "start_ms": 359450,
      "end_ms": 360305,
      "text": "帮扶弱者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00155",
      "start_ms": 361160,
      "end_ms": 362145,
      "text": "一九一五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00156",
      "start_ms": 362470,
      "end_ms": 364665,
      "text": "他牵头成立苏州女子工艺团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00157",
      "start_ms": 365120,
      "end_ms": 367715,
      "text": "专门帮扶底层弱势女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00158",
      "start_ms": 368070,
      "end_ms": 369465,
      "text": "开设就业培训，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00159",
      "start_ms": 369950,
      "end_ms": 371345,
      "text": "提供法律援助，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00160",
      "start_ms": 371710,
      "end_ms": 374430,
      "text": "开展公益义诊庇护。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00161",
      "start_ms": 374470,
      "end_ms": 376795,
      "text": "受欺凌受压迫的女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00162",
      "start_ms": 377240,
      "end_ms": 380215,
      "text": "被苏州百姓亲切称作王老虎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00163",
      "start_ms": 380740,
      "end_ms": 382415,
      "text": "专替弱者撑腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00164",
      "start_ms": 382830,
      "end_ms": 383925,
      "text": "为女性发声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00165",
      "start_ms": 384560,
      "end_ms": 388945,
      "text": "他一生积蓄大多用于办学助学、公益帮扶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00166",
      "start_ms": 389390,
      "end_ms": 391825,
      "text": "七十岁受遗悉数捐校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00167",
      "start_ms": 392150,
      "end_ms": 395975,
      "text": "临终遗嘱捐赠全部奠移设立奖学金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00168",
      "start_ms": 396560,
      "end_ms": 398895,
      "text": "一生与人终身奉献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00169",
      "start_ms": 399400,
      "end_ms": 402555,
      "text": "这份无私向善、利他担当的品格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00170",
      "start_ms": 403130,
      "end_ms": 404690,
      "text": "代代传承让，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00171",
      "start_ms": 404690,
      "end_ms": 407665,
      "text": "家族后辈始终心怀善意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00172",
      "start_ms": 408140,
      "end_ms": 410155,
      "text": "懂得感恩、勇于奉献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00173",
      "start_ms": 410660,
      "end_ms": 411545,
      "text": "成才之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00174",
      "start_ms": 411790,
      "end_ms": 414295,
      "text": "不忘反哺社会、报效国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00175",
      "start_ms": 414780,
      "end_ms": 418345,
      "text": "成就了家族百年不衰的口碑与底蕴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00176",
      "start_ms": 419160,
      "end_ms": 420980,
      "text": "回看谢长达的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00177",
      "start_ms": 421440,
      "end_ms": 423080,
      "text": "他不是高官权贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00178",
      "start_ms": 423500,
      "end_ms": 424940,
      "text": "不是富商巨骨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00179",
      "start_ms": 425360,
      "end_ms": 427160,
      "text": "只是一位裹着小脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00180",
      "start_ms": 427300,
      "end_ms": 429060,
      "text": "历经风雨的普通母亲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00181",
      "start_ms": 429540,
      "end_ms": 430980,
      "text": "但他用一生证明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00182",
      "start_ms": 431400,
      "end_ms": 434620,
      "text": "真正的豪门从不是财富的堆积，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00183",
      "start_ms": 434920,
      "end_ms": 436420,
      "text": "而是家风的堆承。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00184",
      "start_ms": 436900,
      "end_ms": 437920,
      "text": "真正的育儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00185",
      "start_ms": 438260,
      "end_ms": 439960,
      "text": "从不是物质的堆积，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00186",
      "start_ms": 440520,
      "end_ms": 442280,
      "text": "而是精神的滋养。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00187",
      "start_ms": 443180,
      "end_ms": 445160,
      "text": "世间所有的岁月静好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00188",
      "start_ms": 445620,
      "end_ms": 446600,
      "text": "家族荣光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00189",
      "start_ms": 446880,
      "end_ms": 449390,
      "text": "结缘于前辈的负重前行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00190",
      "start_ms": 449770,
      "end_ms": 451290,
      "text": "深耕坚守谢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00191",
      "start_ms": 451290,
      "end_ms": 453630,
      "text": "长达以一介女子之躯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00192",
      "start_ms": 453910,
      "end_ms": 455610,
      "text": "活成了时代标杆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00193",
      "start_ms": 456130,
      "end_ms": 457210,
      "text": "母亲典范。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00194",
      "start_ms": 457990,
      "end_ms": 459850,
      "text": "她的坚韧通透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00195",
      "start_ms": 460230,
      "end_ms": 460810,
      "text": "善良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00196",
      "start_ms": 461130,
      "end_ms": 461650,
      "text": "担当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00197",
      "start_ms": 462530,
      "end_ms": 463570,
      "text": "跨越百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00198",
      "start_ms": 463890,
      "end_ms": 466730,
      "text": "依旧治愈世人启迪后人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00199",
      "start_ms": 466890,
      "end_ms": 468290,
      "text": "最好的家庭教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00200",
      "start_ms": 468530,
      "end_ms": 471290,
      "text": "从来不是给孩子最好的一切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00201",
      "start_ms": 471830,
      "end_ms": 474570,
      "text": "而是自己活成最好的榜样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00202",
      "start_ms": 475130,
      "end_ms": 476610,
      "text": "传承一身风骨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00203",
      "start_ms": 476850,
      "end_ms": 477810,
      "text": "一世善良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00204",
      "start_ms": 478210,
      "end_ms": 479315,
      "text": "一生自强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00205",
      "start_ms": 480390,
      "end_ms": 487115,
      "text": "这便是谢长达留给后世最珍贵最值得传承的人生智慧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00206",
      "start_ms": 487630,
      "end_ms": 488915,
      "text": "乱世无人撑腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00207",
      "start_ms": 489240,
      "end_ms": 490160,
      "text": "他自己做官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00208",
      "start_ms": 490380,
      "end_ms": 491615,
      "text": "一生无依无靠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00209",
      "start_ms": 491980,
      "end_ms": 493805,
      "text": "他活成整座家族的靠山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00210",
      "start_ms": 494360,
      "end_ms": 498085,
      "text": "这样的中国女性值得被更多人看见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00211",
      "start_ms": 498510,
      "end_ms": 499050,
      "text": "点赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00212",
      "start_ms": 499090,
      "end_ms": 499995,
      "text": "致敬先辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00213",
      "start_ms": 500300,
      "end_ms": 500720,
      "text": "转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00214",
      "start_ms": 500820,
      "end_ms": 501755,
      "text": "传递力量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00215",
      "start_ms": 502190,
      "end_ms": 504910,
      "text": "喜欢这种温柔又有力量的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3b605f84d647c9a0_s00216",
      "start_ms": 504970,
      "end_ms": 505725,
      "text": "记得关注我。"
    }
  ],
